      "message": "The bazel Stage2 SDK doesn\u0027t have `which`. You need to add it as a `BDEPEND` if you want to use it. The easier thing to do is switch to `test -e /usr/bin/x86_64-pc-linux-gnu-$(CROSS_COMPILE_CC_NAME)`, but I question the hard coding of this path.\n\nMaybe `BUILDCC?\u003d$(shell type -P x86_64-linux-gnu-$(CROSS_COMPILE_CC_NAME) || echo $(CROSS_COMPILE_CC_NAME))`\n\nIt\u0027s also a bit strange that we are mixing the `CROSS_COMPILE_CC_NAME` which is a target variable with a BUILDXXX variables.",
